@api = http://localhost:3001
@csrf = COLE_CSRF_TOKEN_DO_LOGIN
@webhookToken = COLE_TOKEN_LOCAL_DE_32_CARACTERES
@membershipId = COLE_UUID_DE_FILIAÇÃO
@eventId = evt_fixture_001

### Login: copie o csrfToken da resposta e mantenha o cookie no cliente HTTP
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@exemplo.invalid","password":"COLE_SENHA_LOCAL"}

### Sessão
GET {{api}}/auth/me

### Consultas
GET {{api}}/memberships?page=1&limit=20

### Doações
GET {{api}}/donations?page=1&limit=20

### Indicadores
GET {{api}}/reports/summary

### Decisão: CONSULTA deve receber 403
POST {{api}}/memberships/{{membershipId}}/decision
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"status":"APROVADA","reason":"Decisão da equipe"}

### Fixture local, não é resposta real do Asaas
POST {{api}}/webhooks/asaas
Content-Type: application/json
asaas-access-token: {{webhookToken}}

{"id":"evt_fixture_001","event":"PAYMENT_RECEIVED","payment":{"id":"pay_fixture_001","customer":"cus_fixture_001","paymentLink":"link_fixture_doacao","value":25,"billingType":"PIX","status":"RECEIVED","dueDate":"2026-10-30"}}

### Reprocessamento: CONSULTA deve receber 403
POST {{api}}/events/{{eventId}}/retry
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### Sair
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
